  <str key="93354268-ucdt" type="ucdt" originalKey="93354268">三叶草动态迷彩</str>
  <str key="831433690-ucdt" type="ucdt" originalKey="831433690">将载具的航迹云变为绿叶形态。</str>
  <str key="1035842923-ucdt" type="ucdt" originalKey="1035842923">伊萨米尔风雪动态迷彩</str>
